{"id":"natural","lemma":"natural","pos":"adj","rank":1156,"glosses":["natural (of or relating to nature)","native; indigenous","natural, plain (without artificial additives)"],"ipa":"/natuˈɾal/","forms":{"femininePlural":"naturales"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e8/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-natural.wav","examples":[{"text":"No es natural.","en":"It's not natural.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/442725","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null]},{"text":"Ocurrió de forma natural.","en":"It happened naturally.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/459930","words":[{"g":"to happen, to occur","l":"ocurrir"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"shape"},null]},{"text":"El país es rico en recursos naturales.","en":"The country is rich in natural resources.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1195656","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"country"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"rich"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"writ","l":"recurso"},null]},{"text":"Es bastante natural en él pensar así.","en":"It's quite natural for him to think so.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/705329","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"quite"},null,{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"he"},{"g":"to think, ponder"},{"g":"like this"}]},{"text":"¿Su cabello es rojo natural?","en":"Is her hair naturally red?","words":[{"g":"his / her / your"},{"g":"hair"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"red"},null]}]}